 Details -\r\n\r\n1. Game: Free Fire\r\n2. Event: Esports World Cup 2026\r\n3. Location: Paris\r\n4. Dates: 15 July – 18 July 2026\r\n5. Format: Offline (LAN) international tournament\r\n6. Teams: 24 qualified teams from multiple regions\r\n7. Prize Pool: $1,000,000 USD\r\n8. Additional Reward: Qualification opportunity for the FFWS Global Finals 2026.\r\n\r\nWhy EWC 2026 Is Special -\r\nThis edition expands from 18 teams to 24 teams, making it the largest EWC Free Fire event so far. More regions are participating through dedicated qualification pathways, including South Asia, Latin America, Brazil, MENA, Bangladesh, Africa, and others.\r\n\r\nTournament Format -\r\n1. The competition is expected to feature:\r\n2. Group Stage – Teams are divided into groups and earn points through eliminations and placements.\r\n3. Survival Stage – Teams fight for the remaining Finals spots.\r\n4. Grand Finals – Uses the Champion Rush format, where teams must reach a target score and then secure a Booyah (match victory) to become champions.\r\nRoad to EWC 2026\r\n\r\nTeams qualify through regional tournaments such as:\r\n1. FFWS Brazil\r\n2. FFWS LATAM\r\n3. FFWS India\r\n4. FFWS Pakistan\r\n5. FFWS Africa\r\n6. FFWS MENA\r\n7. FFWS SEA and other regional circuits.\r\n8. FFWS Bangladesh\r\n\r\nImportance of the Event -\r\nThe Free Fire EWC is considered one of the most prestigious mobile esports tournaments because:\r\n1. It features the strongest teams from every major region.\r\n2. It offers a million-dollar prize pool.\r\n3. It serves as a major stepping stone toward the Free Fire World Series Global Finals.\r\n4. It is part of the larger EWC ecosystem, which has a total prize pool of around $75 million across all esports titles.", "location": "Trade Fair Paris Expo Porte de Versailles, Porte de Versailles, Quartier Saint-Lambert, 15th Arrondissement, Paris, Ile-de-France, Metropolitan France, 75015, France", "date": "2026-07-15T18:00:00Z", "capacity": 1000, "created_by": ["Himanshu"], "image": "event_images/ffewc.jfif", "category": "Esports", "latitude": 48.8287212, "longitude": 2.2889813, "is_published": false, "terms_accepted": false, "status": "finished", "finished_at": "2026-07-24T07:01:06.247Z", "cleanup_after": "2026-07-31T07:01:06.247Z"}}, {"model": "events.event", "pk": 16, "fields": {"title": "ds", "description": "fds", "location": "Delhi, India", "date": "2026-07-30T07:01:00Z", "capacity": 100, "created_by": ["Himanshu"], "image": "", "category": "Tech", "latitude": 28.6138954, "longitude": 77.2090057, "is_published": true, "terms_accepted": true, "status": "active", "finished_at": null, "cleanup_after": null}}, {"model": "events.tickettier", "pk": 13, "fields": {"event": 15, "name": "General", "price": "1000.00", "capacity": 500}}, {"model": "events.tickettier", "pk": 14, "fields": {"event": 15, "name": "VIP", "price": "5000.00", "capacity": 97}}, {"model": "events.tickettier", "pk": 15, "fields": {"event": 15, "name": "East Tier", "price": "2500.00", "capacity": 200}}, {"model": "events.tickettier", "pk": 16, "fields": {"event": 15, "name": "West Tier", "price": "2500.00", "capacity": 197}}, {"model": "events.tickettier", "pk": 17, "fields": {"event": 16, "name": "General", "price": "10.00", "capacity": 100}}, {"model": "events.booking", "pk": 16, "fields": {"event": 15, "user": ["Panditji_07"], "ticket_tier": 13, "ticket_type": "General", "price": "1000.00", "booked_at": "2026-06-06T15:25:19.899Z", "qr_code": "qr_codes/booking_16.png", "is_used": false, "payment_status": "pending", "razorpay_order_id": null, "razorpay_payment_id": null}}, {"model": "events.booking", "pk": 17, "fields": {"event": 16, "user": ["imback"], "ticket_tier": 17, "ticket_type": "General", "price": "10.00", "booked_at": "2026-07-26T09:43:51.528Z", "qr_code": "qr_codes/booking_17.png", "is_used": false, "payment_status": "paid", "razorpay_order_id": "order_TI5N2UtKx4dImw", "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_TI5OAmXEY5F1J2"}}, {"model": "events.booking", "pk": 1